  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あいての　まわりに　むすうの　いわを\nうかべて　こうたいで　でてきた　あいての\nポケモンに　ダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대의 주위에 무수한 바위를\n띄워 교체해서 나온 상대\n포켓몬에게 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在對手周圍撒下無數飄浮的岩石，\n讓對手替換出場的寶可夢受到傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lance des pierres flottantes autour de l’ennemi,\nqui blessent tout adversaire entrant au combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender legt eine Falle aus schwebenden Steinen\naus, die gegnerische Pokémon verletzen, die in den\nKampf gerufen werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una trampa de rocas que flota en el aire y daña a los\nobjetivos que entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa piazza una trappola di rocce sospese\nche danneggia i nemici che entrano in campo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user lays a trap of levitating stones around the\nopposing team. The trap hurts opposing Pokémon\nthat switch into battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手の　周りに　無数の　岩を\n浮かべて　交代で　でてきた　相手の\nポケモンに　ダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将无数岩石悬浮在对手的周围，\n从而对替换出场的\n对手的宝可梦给予伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una trampa de rocas que flota en el aire y daña a los\nobjetivos que entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
